<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-MOULOUDIA OF ORAN BEAT VITA OF ZAIRE 2-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOULOUDIA OF ORAN BEAT VITA OF ZAIRE 2-0.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Mouloudia of Oran beat</p>
<p>Vita Club from Zaire 2-0 (1-0) in a preliminary match for the</p>
<p>quarter finals of the African Confederation Football cup on</p>
<p>Saturday. </p>
<p>Scorers: Cheikh Benzarga (43rd minute) and Sabih Ali (46th</p>
<p>minute).</p>
</text>
